-- "A seller who still has listings cannot close their account", said as a
-- refusal over the request, with the listing's seller required. The `never`
-- turns away every CloseAccount whose seller a listing points at, so
-- ApplyClose can only delete a seller nothing points at. Check V24 refuses the
-- delete all the same: it does not read the `never`.

act Seller {
    name: text
}

act Listing {
    title: text
    seller: one Seller
}

transient act CloseAccount {
    seller: one Seller
}

never (CloseAccount where exists (Listing where seller == this.seller))

rule ApplyClose when CloseAccount {
    delete seller
}
